[00:21.14]The way of the truth is the best way of living,
[00:28.22]But no one can live your life for you.
[00:35.05]So take the advice that Jehovah is giving;
[00:42.62]Believe what he tells you is true.
[00:49.53](Chorus)
[00:49.68]Make the truth your own.
[00:55.64]Make it live, yes, make it real.
[01:02.84]And then feel the joy
[01:06.76]Jehovah gives you
[01:11.12]When you make the truth your own.
[01:17.58]The effort you make and the time you are spending
[01:34.41]In service to God and his Kingdom
[01:43.09]Will yield rich results and a life that’s unending,
[01:51.13]A life full of good things to come.
[01:56.54](Chorus)
[01:56.69]Make the truth your own.
[02:04.55]Make it live, yes, make it real.
[02:11.72]And then feel the joy
[02:15.58]Jehovah gives you
[02:19.64]When you make the truth your own.
[02:27.74]Compared with our God, we are all little children
[02:30.68]And need his direction and counsel.
[02:32.53]So walk ev’ry day with our Father in heaven;
[02:34.69]Receive his rich blessing in full.
[02:36.32](Chorus)
[02:36.47]Make the truth your own.
[02:37.68]Make it live, yes, make it real.
[02:39.14]And then feel the joy
[02:40.23]Jehovah gives you
[02:41.18]When you make the truth your own.
